## Assumption Challenge
alternate vertices considered: runners, residue colors, endpoint-kind colors,
typed mod-14 colors, gaps, fixed circle sections, section boundaries, wall
crossing events, cover arcs, survivor gates, dead-cover components,
branch-coloured blockers, and proof obligations.
chosen carrier vertices: low-rank survivor gates decorated by endpoint kind,
typed residue, branch mask, adjacency, and adjacent cover deltas.
preserved predicate: whether a dead-cover obstruction has a graph-composable
rank <= 2 E/branch gate feeding HYP-3451.
destroyed by scalarization: whether the AP84 four-color packet is present,
whether same-branch gates need gluing sidecars, and which owner-delta
coordinates random rows require.

