## Lemma Target
Audited finite form:
  dead_components(row) > 0
    => row has a rank <= 2 survivor gate with one E endpoint and one
       B0/B1 endpoint.
This strengthens HYP-3453's rank <= 2 survivor-gate transversal.  The old
14-colored reservoir survives as typed residue words on those E/branch
gates, but the AP84 four-color packet is not universal: only 67/130 dead
rows contain it.  The legal global proof quotient is therefore
colored gate word = typed residue + branch mask + adjacency + cover delta,
with HYP-3462 handling the AP84 corridor splice,
HYP-3470 handling exact AP84 CRT placement,
HYP-3454/HYP-3456/HYP-3457 handling the AP packet, and HYP-3455
handling same-branch/random gluing stress.

